{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13104030","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13104030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1310403001:0":{"text":"사람 한 명과 햄스터 두 마리, 한 마리는 투구를 쓰고 있고, 한 마리는 고깔모자를 쓰고 있는... 맞네, 맞아, 바로 여러분이시군요!","source_cn":"一个人和两只大仓鼠，一只戴着金属头盔，一只戴着大尖帽子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75449B88B9CE40B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310403002:0":{"text":"네? 저희요?","source_cn":"啊？我们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51075D4089E9A1A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310403003:0":{"text":"공주님의 귀빈이시죠?! 공주님께서 제게 직접 여러분이 무도회 때 입을 의상을 준비하라고 분부하셨거든요.","source_cn":"哎呀，你们肯定是公主殿下的贵客！殿下亲自来吩咐过，要我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF384A2B00CDE2C62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310403004:0":{"text":"걱정 마세요, 금액은 공주님께서 이미 지불하셨어요. 자, 물건들 잘 챙기시고요.","source_cn":"放心，殿下已经付过钱了。来，请拿好您的物品。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA766C88EC4047C17","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"걱정 마세요, 금액은 공주님께서 이미 지불하셨어요. 자, 물건들 잘 챙기시고요.","female":"걱정 마세요, 금액은 공주님께서 이미 지불하셨어요. 자, 물건들 잘 챙기시고요.","variant_male_record_index":"143355","variant_female_record_index":"143356","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310403005:0":{"text":"감사합니다! 공주님께선 정말 좋은 분이시네요!","source_cn":"谢谢！公主殿下真是太善良了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB1800536577045C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310403006:0":{"text":"어라, 왜 저와 해미의 가면은 없는 건가요?","source_cn":"咦，怎么没有我和漫漫的面具呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA507E387B7BE5874","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310403007:0":{"text":"정말 죄송해요. 창고를 모두 뒤져봤지만, 여러분 얼굴형에 맞는 가면을 찾지 못했어요.","source_cn":"尊贵的客人，真是抱歉。我翻遍了仓库，实在是没有找到适合...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x756B8A51119810F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:服装商人":{"text":"의상 상인","source":"服装商人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}